# Data-safety denylist — COPY this file to `.sanitize_blocklist` and add your
# own real terms there. `.sanitize_blocklist` is git-ignored and must never be
# committed. Do NOT put real names in THIS example file.
#
# One term per line. Case-insensitive substring match. `#` starts a comment.
# Alternatively set FACTORYFLOW_SANITIZE_TERMS="Term A,Term B" (e.g. in CI).
#
# Add the real names your sanitized project must never leak, for example:
#   - real customer / retailer / distributor names
#   - the real product brand you reimplemented
#   - internal identifiers, private repo names, personal emails/usernames
#
# Placeholder examples (replace with your own):
Acme Corporation
Globex Foods
jdoe@example.com
